  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Skills Development System for a Sustainable Mining Industry in Mauritania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This concept is designed to address the critical skills gap between local job seekers and employers in Mauritania&apos;s mining industry. By providing demand-driven skills development, the initiative aims to reduce youth under-employment, a pressing issue in the country, while simultaneously enhancing the productivity and sustainability of Mauritania&apos;s strategic mining industry, thereby contributing to the country#s socio-economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
